      <title>Rural homelessness growing faster than cities</title>
      <link>https://www.ipm.org/news/2026-01-20/rural-homelessness-growing-faster-than-cities</link>
      <description>Rural areas saw a 16.6% increase in people experiencing homelessness between 2023 and 2025, according to Indiana Housing and Community Development Authority data. During that same time period, urban areas saw a 9.4% increase.</description>
