      <title>Senate committee adopts state tax cut for overtime and tips</title>
      <link>https://www.ipm.org/news/2026-01-20/senate-committee-adopts-state-tax-cut-for-overtime-and-tips</link>
      <description>A key finance panel on Tuesday inserted a one-year state income tax break on overtime and tips for Hoosier workers. The amendment would cost the state $251 million in tax revenue and that loss would be covered by the growing state surplus.</description>
